TI  - Measuring small area inequality using spatial microsimulation: Lessons learned from Australia
AU  - Miranti, Riyana
AU  - Cassells, Rebecca
AU  - Vidyattama, Yogi
AU  - McNamara, Justine
VL  - 8
IS  - 2
PY  - 2015
DA  - 2015/08/31
